							var StoreDefaults = {"PartnerEventStore":[{"gid":"679638395625931875","clan_steamid":"103582791475758179","event_name":"Traffic Rules: Signs, Violations, and Police","event_type":28,"appid":2366590,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1792503000,"rtime32_end_time":0,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"{\"localized_subtitle\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_summary\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_title_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_capsule_image\":[\"b1747d57074aa4f1ad44645e07a570bf41a3c71d.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"bSaleEnabled\":false,\"sale_show_creator\":false,\"sale_sections\":[],\"sale_browsemore_text\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_url\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_color\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_bgcolor\":\"\",\"localized_sale_header\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_overlay\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_mobile_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_logo\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"sale_font\":\"\",\"sale_background_color\":\"\",\"sale_header_offset\":530,\"referenced_appids\":[],\"bBroadcastEnabled\":false,\"broadcastChatSetting\":\"hide\",\"default_broadcast_title\":\"#Broadcast_default_title_dev\",\"localized_broadcast_title\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_left_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_right_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"broadcast_whitelist\":[],\"bScheduleEnabled\":false,\"scheduleEntries\":[]}","announcement_body":{"gid":"679638395625931876","clanid":"46236771","posterid":"0","headline":"Traffic Rules: Signs, Violations, and Police","posttime":1792503041,"updatetime":1792503041,"body":"[p]Rideshare isn\u2019t a driving exam, but traffic rules directly affect every shift you take. The road network is built around an underlying traffic graph, so signs and road rules are not just decoration\u2014they are part of the gameplay systems.[\/p][p][\/p][h3][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46236771\/b1747d57074aa4f1ad44645e07a570bf41a3c71d.png\"][\/img][\/h3][p][\/p][h3][b]Road Signs[\/b][\/h3][p]In the Ottoberg, you will come across speed limits, stop signs, parking and turning restrictions, one-way streets, lane directions, pedestrian crossings, bus stops, parking areas, residential zones, dead ends, and other familiar road signs.[\/p][p]Many of them are placed procedurally according to the rules defined in the road graph, so they match the traffic layout of each particular road section.[\/p][p][\/p][p][\/p][h3][b]What Counts as a Violation?[\/b][\/h3][p]The game tracks a fairly wide range of violations, including speeding, running red lights, crossing the stop line, failing to stop at a stop sign, driving into oncoming traffic, turning from the wrong lane, incorrect use of turn signals, driving between lanes or off the road, stopping on a pedestrian crossing, failing to yield to pedestrians, and causing accidents.[\/p][p]Crashing into a police car is, for obvious reasons, an especially bad idea. \ud83d\ude42[\/p][p]Careful driving is rewarded, too. Using your turn signals correctly, maintaining a reasonable speed, waiting at red lights, and keeping a safe following distance can earn you bonuses.[\/p][p]Traffic rules matter for more than simply getting into trouble with the police. Some passengers pay close attention to how you drive and whether you follow the rules. This can affect their mood and, in turn, your tips.[\/p][p][\/p][p][\/p][h3][b]Police & Cameras[\/b][\/h3][p]Police patrols drive around the city, and traffic cameras are installed on the roads, but their locations aren\u2019t shown on the map by default.[\/p][p]The main principle is simple: someone has to actually catch you breaking the rules. If you speed or commit another violation outside their observation area, you may get away with it. Heck, even if you\u2019re spotted, sometimes you can still leave the observation area quickly enough to avoid the fine.[\/p][p]Which, by the way, fines can be significant enough to take a noticeable bite out of your earnings for the shift, so be careful![\/p][p]Later, you can purchase two separate upgrades: one reveals traffic cameras on the map, while the other shows police patrols. You can install both and get a much clearer picture of where the roads are being watched and how.[\/p][p]Vehicle models matter too: some cars are less conspicuous and attract less police attention.[\/p][p]That\u2019s it for now, thank you for following along with us as we dive into the systems of Rideshare \u201cStimulator\u201d![\/p][p]\n[\/p]","commentcount":6,"tags":["mod_reviewed","ModAct_1894626024_1792504926_0"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"565922930124606028","event_gid":"679638395625931875","voteupcount":77,"votedowncount":0,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":1792503000,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"565922930124606028","rtime32_last_modified":1793284526,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1792504927,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1792180308,"votes_up":77,"votes_down":0,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"585055827813077553","gidfeature2":"565922930124606028"},{"gid":"679638395625932258","clan_steamid":"103582791475758179","event_name":"Demo is out now + Management Trailer","event_type":28,"appid":2366590,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1792413540,"rtime32_end_time":1792417140,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"{\"localized_subtitle\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_summary\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_title_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_capsule_image\":[\"431613d3d4ff114099475caf4b56baecaf52d8ea.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"bSaleEnabled\":false,\"sale_show_creator\":false,\"sale_sections\":[],\"sale_browsemore_text\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_url\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_color\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_bgcolor\":\"\",\"localized_sale_header\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_overlay\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_mobile_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_logo\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"sale_font\":\"\",\"sale_background_color\":\"\",\"sale_header_offset\":530,\"referenced_appids\":[],\"bBroadcastEnabled\":false,\"broadcastChatSetting\":\"hide\",\"default_broadcast_title\":\"#Broadcast_default_title_dev\",\"localized_broadcast_title\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_left_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_right_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"broadcast_whitelist\":[],\"bScheduleEnabled\":false,\"scheduleEntries\":[]}","announcement_body":{"gid":"679638395625932259","clanid":"46236771","posterid":"0","headline":"Demo is out now + Management Trailer","posttime":1792413565,"updatetime":1792413565,"body":"[p]Make every trip count!\u00a0\n[\/p][p]Success starts with how you manage what you have today. Keep your passengers happy, maintain a clean car and save up for a better ride.[\/p][p][\/p][p]Remember: Your car. Your business. Your future.\n[\/p][p][dynamiclink href=\"https:\/\/youtu.be\/8yYldvBsD9c\"][\/dynamiclink][\/p][p align=\"justify\"]Ready to book your first ride? Check out the free [i]Rideshare \"Stimulator\"[\/i] demo as part of Steam Next Fest today![\/p][p][\/p][p align=\"justify\"][i]Rideshare \u201cStimulator\u201d[\/i] puts you in the driver's seat to drop off a variety of quirky passengers, all of whom have a story that's either captivating, hilarious, or just plain weird. Follow real-world traffic laws and systems, master your vehicle's controls and handling, and keep your passengers happy to earn positive ratings that help grow your business with new and upgradable rides.[\/p][p][\/p][p align=\"justify\"]Hop behind the wheel and cruise across a stunning metropolitan world full of sights, sounds, and turns. Your driving style and the condition of your vehicle will impact your overall rating, reviews, and tips, so keep your vehicle in tip-top shape and be ready for whoever jumps in the backseat![\/p][p]\n\n[\/p]","commentcount":11,"tags":["mod_reviewed","ModAct_1889321037_1792417281_0"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"565922930124493914","event_gid":"679638395625932258","voteupcount":83,"votedowncount":1,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":0,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"565922930124493914","rtime32_last_modified":1793284527,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1792417282,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1792413558,"votes_up":83,"votes_down":1,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"585055827813077553","gidfeature2":"565922930124493914"}],"EventWebRowEmbed":{"bPreLoaded":true,"announcementGIDList":["679638395625931876","679638395625932259"],"last_update_event":[]}};
						</script>
					

					<div data-featuretarget="events-row"></div>
				
								
				
				


								<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" >Rideshare &quot;Stimulator&quot; is an immersive driving simulation game that puts you behind the wheel as a rideshare business owner. Dodge traffic, follow the rules, and race the clock to drop off your quirky passengers, each with a story that's either captivating, hilarious, or just plain weird. </p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Because you never know who you’re going to pick up next… </p><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Expand Your Rideshare Business: Your driving style and the condition of your vehicle directly influence how passengers react, affecting your overall rating, reviews, and tips.</p></li></ul><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Have Stimulating Conversations: Each ride presents players with unique and unpredictable passenger stories, ensuring a diverse and engaging gameplay experience.</p></li></ul><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Dodge Real-world Traffic &amp; Pedestrians: The city comes to life with dynamic real-world traffic. Wait for traffic lights, yield to pedestrians, and navigate the intricacies of a well-regulated traffic system.</p></li></ul><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Experience a Living, Breathing City: A visually stunning game world, crafted to offer immersive environments. Cruise through streets inspired by both European and American cities, each with its unique charm and beauty</p></li></ul><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Master Intuitive Car Controls: The game provides intuitive and accessible car controls, designed to offer an enjoyable driving experience for all players.</p></li></ul><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Maintain Your Vehicle: Between rides, keep the car clean, fix what needs fixing, and make sure it’s ready for whoever gets in next.</p></li></ul>						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="game_page_autocollapse">
		<div id="game_area_content_descriptors" class="game_area_description">
			<h2>AI Generated Content Disclosure</h2>
			<p>The developers describe how their game uses AI Generated Content like this:</p>
			<p><i>
					The main Campaign story, characters, and dialogue were written by a team of human writers and voiced in English by human actors. AI tools were used to localize text and voice overs.<br />
<br />
The optional Free Ride mode includes AI-generated passenger missions and localized dialogue. Free Ride mode is separate from the main Campaign and can be skipped by players who prefer to experience only human-written narrative content.<br />
<br />
Both game modes include radio stations featuring a mix of human-made music and AI-generated music. Stations containing AI-generated music are clearly labeled as such in the game.				</i>
			</p>
					</div>
	</div>
	
				
				
