								<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class="bb_ul"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 1500X (4C/8T) / Intel Core i5-8400 (6C/6T)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 6 GB VRAM, NVIDIA GTX 1060 / AMD RX 590<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 50 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD required</li></ul>							</ul>
